From 0d06a1283b9ef376cb64af4754b99f702aa4cef5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 06:08:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Major upgrade: parties, expenses, day close, van stock,
 offline queue, token refresh, line-item ordering

Token refresh: Dio interceptor auto-refreshes JWT on 401 (serialized via
Completer), retries the request; forces logout on refresh failure.

Parties (was placeholder): debounced contact search from ERP, cards with
type icon, phone, city, outstanding AR in red; detail screen with
receivable/payable/credit-limit/terms MetricTiles + GSTIN/address.

Expenses (was static): connected to /api/v1/expenses; resolves expense
CoA account by category keywords and cash account (1010) automatically;
today's expense list with status.

Day close (new): visit/order/collection summary, cash reconciliation
form, initiate+submit, status banners (SUBMITTED/APPROVED/REJECTED),
handles FS_DAY_CLOSE_ALREADY_EXISTS gracefully.

Van stock (new): assigned-van stock balance with low-stock highlight,
request load / return stock dialogs, transfer history with status chips.

Offline queue (new): SharedPreferences-backed queue; check-in/out,
orders, collections auto-queue on network errors; sync screen shows
pending items with retry counts; 30s auto-sync drains queue when online.

Line-item ordering (new): OrderBuilderScreen with debounced item search,
cart with qty steppers + editable rates, creates a real Sales Order via
/api/v1/sales-orders, acknowledges credit warnings, links SO to the
visit; two-option bottom sheet (Build order / Quick amount) on visit and
orders screens.

Navigation: Day Close replaces Sync in bottom nav (Sync moved to app
bar), Van added as 8th tab.
